{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Well Fed replacement through custom and stock food consumption",
  "contract": [
    "Only the latest Well Fed grants bonuses; eating custom or stock food preserves unrelated buffs.",
    "Each Well Fed is cut by the content-scaling multiplier of the item it came from, also when the last item of",
    "the stack is eaten. At cap 60 Classic spans 1-45 and items map through band 1-60 -> 1-45.",
    "Loaf 772065 and perch 772066: item level 25 -> 19, stat multiplier 0.76, required level 15 -> 11, rating",
    "multiplier 0.76 * (11/15)^2 = 0.409. Loaf Well Fed 19733 grants lround(3 * 0.76) = 2 Strength, 2 Stamina and",
    "lround(2 * 0.409) = 1 expertise rating; perch Well Fed 19741 grants 2 Agility, 2 Stamina and 1 expertise rating.",
    "Egg 6888: item level 4 -> 3, multiplier 0.75, so Well Fed 19705 keeps lround(2 * 0.75) = 2 Stamina and 2 Spirit."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "players": [
    { "id": "eater", "race": 1, "class": 1, "level": 60 }
  ],
  "steps": [
    { "action": "set_aura", "actor": "eater", "spell": 8112, "stacks": 1 },
